Function definition

+-------------------------------------------- the keyword function
|
|          +--------------------------------- the name you invent
|          |
|          |     +--------------------------- the parameter name
|          |     |
|          |     |       +------------------- the parameter type
|          |     |       |
|          |     |       |       +----------- the return type
|          |     |       |       |
v          v     v       v       v
"function smile(happy: boolean): void {"          |
    "// your drawing code goes here"              +--- the body
"}"                                               |


Function call

  +---------------- the name from the definition
  |
  |    +----------- the argument you pass in
  |    |
  v    v
"smile(true);"      this line runs the function
